  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Life-Saving Protection and Health-Care Support to Migrants and Other Populations in Vulnerable Situations in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to mitigate the negative impact of Lebanon&#x2019;s continued economic deterioration on the protection environment for migrants and other vulnerable populations. Through this project, IOM is improving access to lifesaving humanitarian protection and health-care services for vulnerable individuals.</narrative>
